        "evidence": "The block is two sentences and the second one, 'This provides an algebraic framework that captures the combinatorial constraints of the lepton sector.', adds no fact to the first. It names no constraint, no framework component and no consequence; it upgrades the single preceding claim into a grander unfalsifiable one. This is the closing-restatement construction in a block short enough that it is half the text.",
